tooltip_text = "[title]Armor Type[/title]
The classification of the equipment. This determines whether an actor can equip the item using the trait settings of the actor or class. The equipment classification that you can select can be changed in the [Types] tab.

[Note]: If the category \"None\" is assigned to this armor, it can be equipped by anyone without restrictions."
